   "gap_before": 2.3,
   "block": "fitness.dlg10",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Not exactly. Benefits seem to rise up to around seven or eight thousand for many people, and more is still good.",
   "est_sec": 6.61,
   "gap_before": 1.03,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "fitness.dlg10"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I'm at like three thousand on a desk day.",
   "est_sec": 2.89,
   "gap_before": 0.4,
   "block": "fitness.dlg10",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Then any increase is a win. Try a ten minute walk after each meal.",
   "est_sec": 4.44,
   "gap_before": 0.69,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "fitness.dlg10"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "After every meal?",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 0.68,
